Keep a shared words as an empty list of text.
Place "Hello" into words.
Place "Alaska" into words.
Place "Dad" into words.
Place "Peace" into words.
Keep a shared bigs as empty text.
Place "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ" into bigs.
Keep a shared smalls as empty text.
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into smalls.
Keep a shared rowone as empty text.
Place "qwertyuiop" into rowone.
Keep a shared rowtwo as empty text.
Place "asdfghjkl" into rowtwo.
Keep a shared rowthree as empty text.
Place "zxcvbnm" into rowthree.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared lowered as empty text.
Keep a shared chosen as 0.
Keep a shared label as 0.
Keep a shared bench as empty text.
Keep a shared word as empty text.
Keep a shared firstrow as 0.
Keep a shared fail as 0.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
To lower from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 25, return.
The bigpiece is the slice of bigs from spot to spot plus 1.
The smallpiece is the slice of smalls from spot to spot plus 1.
If bigpiece matches current, set lowered to smallpiece, return.
If smallpiece matches current, set lowered to current, return.
Lower from spot plus 1.

To rowcheck from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of bench, return.
The piece is the slice of bench from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches lowered, set chosen to label, return.
Rowcheck from spot plus 1.

For each entry in words.
Set word to entry.
The lastchar is the last position of word.
Set firstrow to 0.
Set fail to 0.
For every place from 0 to lastchar.
Set current to the slice of word from place to place plus 1.
Set lowered to current.
Lower from 0.
Set chosen to 0.
Set bench to rowone.
Set label to 1.
Rowcheck from 0.
If chosen is 0, set bench to rowtwo.
If chosen is 0, set label to 2.
If chosen is 0, rowcheck from 0.
If chosen is 0, set bench to rowthree.
If chosen is 0, set label to 3.
If chosen is 0, rowcheck from 0.
If firstrow is 0, set firstrow to chosen.
If chosen is not firstrow, set fail to 1.
If place is lastchar and fail is 0, Place word into answers.

For each line in answers, show line.
